# Taipy serves this directory (the Gui's _root_dir, set via gui._set_frame to the shell module's dir) as static to
# signed-in callers. Exclude the Python source and bytecode so only styles.css (and any font assets) are served.
# Gitignore syntax (Taipy reads it with gitignore_parser). See review V2UI-14.
*.py
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.taipyignore
